{"product_id":"from-this-moment-on","title":"From This Moment On","description":"\u003cp\u003eLynn Stephens' life has been tough recently, thanks to Vincent Boland, the manager at four-star hotel she works in. But, after standing up to him, she is delighted when she is vindicated. Lynn loved her job, and she was good at it and now, with the support and love of her partner, parents and friends, she can put this terrible time behind her and find a job in another hotel. But the consequences of Vincent's actions are more far-reaching than Lynn knows and the aftereffects are still being felt throughout the small town. The Boland family is powerful and influential and it's not long before Lynn realizes that this man still has the capacity to destroy her and all she holds dear.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 155 x 234\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Colette Caddle\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781849838924\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 387\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45336507744409,"sku":"Table-C-4-9781849838924","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/680b8c0346b70_From_This_Moment_On_Colette_Caddle.jpg?v=1745601779","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/from-this-moment-on","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}